WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.659
Mole rowed carefully on.

2
00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:07.151
Rat leaned forward, listening.

3
00:00:07.152 --> 00:00:10.820
"What's wrong with Rat?" thought Mole.

4
00:00:10.821 --> 00:00:14.857
"He's acting strange."

5
00:00:14.858 --> 00:00:19.117
The river divided into two streams.

6
00:00:19.118 --> 00:00:22.775
"Take the smaller stream," ordered Rat.

7
00:00:22.776 --> 00:00:25.983
Mole steered the boat.

8
00:00:25.984 --> 00:00:30.180
"The music is so clear," said Rat.

9
00:00:30.181 --> 00:00:33.098
"Mole, you must hear it now!"

10
00:00:33.099 --> 00:00:36.883
Suddenly Mole stopped rowing.

11
00:00:36.884 --> 00:00:40.621
The music surrounded him.

12
00:00:40.622 --> 00:00:44.496
"You hear it, Mole!" cried Rat.

13
00:00:44.497 --> 00:00:48.251
"It's magical!" said Mole.

14
00:00:48.252 --> 00:00:51.397
"Row on, Mole!" said Rat.

15
00:00:51.398 --> 00:00:55.290
Mole paddled forward again.

16
00:00:55.291 --> 00:00:59.551
"Look at the grass and the trees," said Rat.

17
00:00:59.552 --> 00:01:03.497
"Everything is glowing!" cried Mole.

18
00:01:03.498 --> 00:01:07.009
"Look at the color of those roses!"

19
00:01:07.010 --> 00:01:12.031
"Smell the wildflowers!" said Rat.

20
00:01:12.032 --> 00:01:16.210
Ahead they saw a small island.

21
00:01:16.211 --> 00:01:19.782
Willows grew all around it.

22
00:01:19.783 --> 00:01:22.791
"Let's tie up here," said Mole.

23
00:01:22.792 --> 00:01:25.834
They got out of the boat.

24
00:01:25.835 --> 00:01:30.036
Rat and Mole pushed through the willows.

25
00:01:30.037 --> 00:01:32.614
"Strange," said Rat.

26
00:01:32.615 --> 00:01:36.486
"I feel happy, but also scared."

27
00:01:36.487 --> 00:01:40.833
"I feel the same way," said Mole.

28
00:01:40.834 --> 00:01:45.196
They stepped into a small, bright clearing.

29
00:01:45.197 --> 00:01:48.389
"Dawn is coming," said Mole.

30
00:01:48.390 --> 00:01:52.786
"Oh, the music stopped," said Rat.

31
00:01:52.787 --> 00:01:58.057
Rat and Mole both looked up.

